# ＋ → Station 文件 in a chat: the station's folder lent (this run's e2e-{T}), a file ticked, 添加: its card in the
# draft; sent with words, the message names it by its path (nothing goes up).
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap icon:plus
until Station 文件
tap Station 文件
until 所有位置
until =e2e-{T}
shot 1-places
tap =e2e-{T}
until 整个文件夹
until 说明.txt
tap 说明.txt
until 添加 1 个
shot 2-ticked
tap 添加 1 个
gone 所有位置
until studio · 路径
shot 3-card
tap 发消息
type 看看这个文件 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 看看这个文件 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 4-sent
